---
/**
 * The persistent disclaimer required by ADR-0003 decision 1.
 *
 * Rendered by `Base.astro` on every page. It is deliberately NOT importable
 * with an "off" prop, NOT dismissible, and NOT a link to a disclaimer page:
 *
 *  - No dismiss control, and no JavaScript, so there is nothing to click that
 *    removes it and no persisted "I have seen this" state to honour.
 *  - The full text is here. A link saying "disclaimer" is a thing users decline
 *    to follow, which makes it equivalent to absent.
 *  - It sits above <main>, not in the footer, so it is on screen when the page
 *    loads rather than after a scroll the user may never make.
 *
 * ADR-0003 lists "removing or shrinking the disclaimer in a visual cleanup
 * pass" as explicitly not permitted. Changing any of the above needs a
 * superseding ADR, not a judgement call in this file.
 *
 * `src/layouts/Base.test.ts` asserts that a page which does not itself import
 * this component still renders it.
 */
---

<aside class="disclaimer" aria-labelledby="disclaimer-heading">
  <div class="shell disclaimer__inner">
    {
      /* Decorative: the meaning is carried by the heading text beside it, never
        by the icon or the colour alone. */
    }
    <svg
      class="disclaimer__icon"
      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      width="24"
      height="24"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="2"
      stroke-linecap="round"
      aria-hidden="true"
      focusable="false"
    >
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
      <path d="M12 8v5"></path>
      <path d="M12 16.5v.01"></path>
    </svg>
    <div>
      <h2 id="disclaimer-heading" class="disclaimer__heading">This is not tax advice</h2>
      <p class="disclaimer__body">
        This tool shows what the law, as recorded here, produces from the figures you
        enter. It is not advice and it is not an authority. Check any figure with the
        Inland Revenue Department or a qualified tax practitioner before you file or pay.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  /* Every value below resolves to a token from src/styles/global.css.
     No literal colour, no literal size. */
  .disclaimer {
    background-color: var(--color-caution-subtle);
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--color-caution);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .disclaimer__inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: calc(var(--spacing) * 3);
    padding-block: calc(var(--spacing) * 3);
  }

  .disclaimer__icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--color-caution-strong);
    /* Optically aligns the glyph with the first line of the heading. */
    margin-block-start: calc(var(--spacing) * 0.5);
  }

  .disclaimer__heading {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: var(--text-sm--line-height);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .disclaimer__body {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: var(--text-sm--line-height);
    max-width: var(--container-prose);
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
